# Force LF line endings for everything in this directory regardless of the
# checkout platform. The shell scripts, systemd units, and .desktop launcher
# all run on Linux (the DGX Spark) and will break with CRLF endings even
# though they were authored on Windows. Without this file, git's
# core.autocrlf=true on Windows would replace LF with CRLF on checkout.
*.sh    text eol=lf
*.yml   text eol=lf
*.yaml  text eol=lf
*.service text eol=lf
*.desktop text eol=lf
